From a1d80b25094171a9f7113f7090b282b8baa9cb90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Carney <tim.carney@cargt.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 14:53:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add common LPDDR4X timing support and update configurations

- Introduced a new header file `cargt_lpddr4x_common.h` containing common DDR PHY trained CSR declarations for Cargt LPDDR4X timing variants.
- Updated `spl-cargt.c` to support multiple LPDDR4X timing configurations based on EEPROM data, allowing for dynamic selection of timing based on DRAM size and speed.
- Modified the default timing configurations in the defconfig files for various board versions to use the new 3200 MT/s and 3733 MT/s timing definitions.
